  dialogue:
  - '"What do you find fun in comics...?"'
  - "I would say that I like mysteries and stories about detectives the most.\r\nIt\u2019s
    nice to follow along, and come up with theories about what the truth could be.\r"
  - "I\u2019m not very good at interpreting the clues that are written in, but I
    try my best to find what the solution is supposed to be!"
